% Chapter 5: a slightly bigger world. Every ch05 file loads it
% with `accumulate more_world.` It adds one boss, one chain of
% ownership and a few direct train routes.
accumulate world.
accumulate time.

% ANCHOR: more
% Lumen belongs to Acme, so Lena reports to Anna.
reports_to lena anna.

pred owned_by o:org, o:org.
owned_by kyivTech lumen.
owned_by lumen    acme.

% Direct trains, one direction each.
pred route o:city, o:city.
route porto  lisbon.
route lisbon berlin.
route berlin lviv.
route lviv   kyiv.
% ANCHOR_END: more
